# 34. Usage Prediction

A future feature can estimate:

```text
Current burn rate
12.4k tokens/min

Estimated remaining time
~47 minutes
```

Or:

```text
At current usage,
you may reach the limit
in approximately 1h 12m.
```

Always label predictions as estimates.

Never present predictions as guaranteed.

