The app should look like this conceptually:

```text
              CLAUDE POWER

        █████████████████░░░
                  72%

             2h 14m left


        ACTIVE AI SESSIONS

   ● DA-YO
     Editing Menu.tsx
     ████████████░░ 42.8k

   ● Portal
     Running tests
     ██████░░░░░░░ 18.2k


             TODAY

        438k tokens
          $3.42

        ▁▂▃▅▃▆▇▅▆▇
```

The experience should be:

**Power meter first → sessions second → analytics third.**

Never the other way around.

